      <div class="cg-step final reveal" data-d="3"><p class="round">Grand Final · 决赛</p><p class="opp">FURIA</p><p class="sc">3–0 · 总冠军</p><p class="maps">Mirage 13–8 · Anubis 13–8 · Inferno 13–8</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cg-match reveal">
      <h3>八强 · Team Vitality <span>2–1</span></h3>
      <p class="meta">2026年6月20日 · BO3 · BP：Falcons禁Overpass，Vitality禁Ancient；Falcons选Anubis，Vitality选Inferno，决胜图Dust2。比分均为Falcons在前。</p>
      <div class="cg-maprows">
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Anubis</span><span class="s">13–11</span><span class="h">半场6:6、7:5</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>kyousuke 1.61</b></span></div>
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Inferno</span><span class="s">11–13</span><span class="h">半场6:6、5:7</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>ZywOo 1.72</b>，m0NESY 1.59</span></div>
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Dust2</span><span class="s">13–11</span><span class="h">半场8:4、5:7</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>kyousuke 1.52</b>，TeSeS 1.39</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="take">三张图，两张打到13–11。kyousuke系列Rating 1.41，全场最佳（80.6%投票）。Vitality只赢了ZywOo打出1.72的那张Inferno。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cg-match reveal">
      <h3>四强 · Team Spirit <span>2–1</span></h3>
      <p class="meta">2026年6月21日 · BO3 · BP：Falcons禁Overpass，Spirit禁Inferno；Falcons选Anubis，Spirit选Mirage，决胜图Dust2。比分均为Falcons在前。</p>
      <div class="cg-maprows">
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Anubis</span><span class="s">16–14</span><span class="h">半场6:6、6:6，加时4:2</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>kyousuke 1.44</b>，sh1ro 1.43</span></div>
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Mirage</span><span class="s">8–13</span><span class="h">半场6:6、2:7</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>tN1R 1.76</b>，NiKo 1.40</span></div>
        <div class="cg-maprow"><span class="m">Dust2</span><span class="s">16–12</span><span class="h">半场5:7、7:5，加时4:0</span><span class="p">单图最佳 <b>kyousuke 1.39</b>，m0NESY 1.36</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="take">两张图打进加时，决胜图加时4–0，一局没让。NiKo系列Rating 1.27，拿下全场最佳（71.5%投票）。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="cg-road-note reveal">瑞士轮（Stage 3）3胜1负出线：2–1赢G2，0–2输BetBoom，2–1赢Monte，2–1赢NAVI。</p>
    <p class="cg-road-note reveal">Valve赛后复盘的原话：<span class="en">“Taking on the toughest Playoff bracket in Major history, the Falcons made a triumphant statement at the IEM Cologne 2026 Major.”</span></p>
    <p class="cg-road-note reveal">FURIA同样来势汹汹：八强让一追二淘汰9z，四强2–0横扫Aurora，队史第一次打进Major决赛。决赛面对的是老将FalleN——巴西CS的教父级人物，队史第一次离冠军这么近。FalleN已在同年4月的IEM Rio上宣布，将在2026年底退役。</p>
